WEBVTT

00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:06.670
You chosen young men and women,

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:09.230
born with the qualification 
to wield a Buranki's heart...

00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:13.400
The Buranki hearts that you have obtained

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:18.160
have returned to humans the 
power to hunt and kill Buranki,

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:21.390
by making Buranki their slaves.

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:24.290
Thanks to Leticia's efforts,

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:30.130
90% of the déraciné that lurked 
around Europe have been destroyed.

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:32.650
These are splendid results.

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:35.050
Thank you, Leticia.

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:36.830
I am honored.

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:41.430
I'm also very happy that I was 
successful in protecting my homeland

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:42.850
and the nature that I love.

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:44.780
Hmph. Goody-goody.

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:48.130
Monsieur Guy, do we really 
have no choice but to use

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:49.770
the hearts of these "déraciné"?

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:52.740
Epizo, what you mean to say is this, yes?

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:56.660
That you want to use the heart 
you inherited from your mother.

00:00:56.660 --> 00:00:59.030
Yeah, that's right. Yes!

00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:05.490
I promise that I will make the 
heart your mother gave you work.

00:01:05.490 --> 00:01:09.870
So until then, use that heart to 
protect the world from the evil

00:01:09.870 --> 00:01:11.800
that is the déraciné.

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:13.850
Be a hero.

00:01:13.850 --> 00:01:16.680
A hero? Me?

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:17.550
Yes!

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:19.820
God, that lardo's a pain!

00:01:20.660 --> 00:01:22.900
Honestly, I can't keep up with this idiocy.

00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:26.240
Maxim?

00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:28.440
He has a special mission.

00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:30.820
Only Maxim gets special treatment?

00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:33.420
Save the special treatment for me, Kaoruko!

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:35.320
I'm sorry, Kaoruko.

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:38.830
This is a mission that only 
his team can carry out.

00:01:39.670 --> 00:01:40.780
Kaoruko,

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:46.130
first of all, show me your 
talent as a heart user.

00:01:46.130 --> 00:01:48.040
That is your duty.

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:52.180
Power she got from Kazuki
Migiwa, the witch...

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:55.760
Fine, Guy-sama.

00:01:56.760 --> 00:01:58.670
<i>Just watch me.</i>

00:01:58.670 --> 00:02:00.960
<i>I will protect this world.</i>

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:03.260
<i>Not Maxim, and not Azuma.</i>

00:02:03.830 --> 00:02:07.300
<i>I, Kaoruko, will protect 
the world with Oubu!</i>

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:24.120
<b><i>BUBUKI/BURANKI</i></b>

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:24.110
<b>The Gentle Giants of the Galaxy</b>

00:02:38.550 --> 00:02:39.130
BURANKI

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:42.800
BURANKI

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:46.600
BURANKI

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:06.490
Kazuki

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:06.490
Kaoruko

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:37.400
<b><i>BUBUKI/BURANKI</i></b>

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:37.400
<b>The Gentle Giants of the Galaxy</b>

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:38.980
<b><i>BUBUKI/BURANKI</i></b>

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:38.980
<b>The Gentle Giants of the Galaxy</b>

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:42.490
The City of Taipei

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:53.750
Is that the Buranki Zampaza?!

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:56.340
What are they thinking, setting a Buranki

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:57.670
loose in the middle of the city?

00:03:58.070 --> 00:04:02.230
It looks like Demokratia has already made 
arrangements to keep the media silent.

00:04:02.230 --> 00:04:03.330
What do you mean?

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:06.050
Are they following some kind of plan?

00:04:06.420 --> 00:04:07.810
Wait a sec, everyone!

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:11.070
As per usual, our heart isn't here.

00:04:11.070 --> 00:04:11.840
What?!

00:04:11.840 --> 00:04:14.610
What kind of leader can't work in a group?

00:04:14.610 --> 00:04:16.150
It's nothing less than amazing.

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:18.150
We have no choice, then.

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:20.150
We'll have to buy time.

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:43.450
You expect to fight Zampaza

00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:47.000
with puny Bubuki like those,
you cockroaches?!

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:53.510
I won't let you escape!

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:05.090
A battle like this has no meaning.

00:05:05.090 --> 00:05:07.320
Get out of my sight, cockroaches.

00:05:10.720 --> 00:05:12.080
What are they doing?

00:05:12.990 --> 00:05:15.600
So that's the Russian team's Buranki?

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:17.750
That Buranki is strange.

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:21.000
Five people are in it,
but five people aren't there.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:24.840
Huh? What does that mean, Shizuru-chan?

00:05:58.520 --> 00:06:01.840
Those bastards... How dare 
they... How dare they?!

00:06:17.570 --> 00:06:18.980
Monsieur Guy,

00:06:19.910 --> 00:06:21.090
is this...

00:06:21.090 --> 00:06:24.020
Ah, Maxim, you're awake?

00:06:24.020 --> 00:06:27.610
You had quite a rough time 
at the Buranki nest.

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:29.200
No, that was...

00:06:29.790 --> 00:06:33.620
Yes, yes... I know what you want to say.

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:37.800
Limbs with wills of their own,
who defy their heart...

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:40.090
You have no need for them.

00:06:40.090 --> 00:06:42.840
I am more than aware of your efforts.

00:06:47.740 --> 00:06:51.800
Maxim, I've already made 
adjustments to your limbs.

00:06:52.310 --> 00:06:55.440
By forcibly controlling 
the Bubuki's thoughts,

00:06:55.440 --> 00:06:58.970
their users' egos are sealed inside.

00:06:58.970 --> 00:07:02.280
This will make you even stronger.

00:07:03.350 --> 00:07:06.400
Elder Brother, please give us your orders.

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:19.910
So you've finally shown yourselves, 
you unsightly monsters.

00:07:20.320 --> 00:07:21.950
Two headless Buranki?

00:07:21.950 --> 00:07:23.560
Were they hiding underground?

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:50.780
Hands and feet don't think!

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:52.790
Now this is the team I wanted!

00:07:52.790 --> 00:07:55.370
Excellent! This is excellent!

00:07:58.300 --> 00:07:59.960
Are you kidding me?

00:07:59.960 --> 00:08:02.470
Two headless Buranki, in one instant...

00:08:02.980 --> 00:08:04.630
Hey!

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:06.230
Hey!

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:09.420
Hey!

00:08:10.440 --> 00:08:12.170
Over here!

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:13.300
That voice...

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:15.640
Huh? Where? Where? Where?!

00:08:16.130 --> 00:08:17.390
It can't be...

00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:20.720
Kaoruko?!

00:08:20.720 --> 00:08:22.640
How did she get up there?

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:24.500
How is she going to get down?

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:27.690
My faithful limbs!

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:32.320
Your pointless resistance was pointless, 
but not so pointless at all!

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:34.400
I was watching the whole time!

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:36.450
I observed and analyzed

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:39.450
the way Maxim fights,
 his strategy, his tactics!

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:44.090
So I can see all of that cold-hearted, 
tsundora guy's attacks coming!

00:08:44.090 --> 00:08:45.330
I've seen through them!

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:50.050
You need to tell us about 
that stuff beforehand!

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:56.890
Time for an ultra, super, 
gorgeous, deluxe fusion!

00:09:07.720 --> 00:09:10.260
The color of that heart's light...

00:09:10.810 --> 00:09:12.380
Kazuki Kaoruko, eh?

00:09:12.380 --> 00:09:13.570
Hey, Maxim!

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:15.380
You big doofus!

00:09:15.380 --> 00:09:17.950
Could you stop doing whatever 
you want in my town?

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:19.830
Well, then...

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:22.370
You'll have to try and force me to stop!

00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:32.670
All that big talk,
and that's all you can do?

00:09:33.180 --> 00:09:35.300
You were never a match for me.

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:37.230
You attacked my chest again!

00:09:37.230 --> 00:09:38.330
Why my chest?!

00:09:38.330 --> 00:09:40.710
Are you trying to stimulate 
them so they'll get bigger?!

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:42.940
I seriously don't need 
that type of kindness!

00:09:42.940 --> 00:09:44.310
That's sexual harassment!

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:48.390
I hate to say it, but Maxim is right.

00:09:48.390 --> 00:09:53.050
I used up all my strength climbing 
to the top of that tower.

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:55.820
Kaoruko, you idiot! Idiot! Idiot!

00:09:55.820 --> 00:09:57.710
Silence...

00:09:57.710 --> 00:09:58.950
Huh?

00:10:01.070 --> 00:10:04.540
Kaoruko, why do you fight?

00:10:05.840 --> 00:10:08.640
To make Guy-sama acknowledge my strength!

00:10:08.640 --> 00:10:12.840
I'll become number one and protect 
this town... this world!

00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:18.470
I guess Guy really hasn't told you anything.

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:20.470
Huh? What does that mean?

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:23.040
After knocking the Buranki 
nest out of the sky,

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:25.720
Guy's next target is...

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:28.690
That comet.

00:10:29.090 --> 00:10:31.260
Through the Buranki nest

00:10:31.260 --> 00:10:34.940
and that comet,
Guy's ambition will be fulfilled.

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:37.090
A comet? What?

00:10:37.090 --> 00:10:38.820
What are you saying?

00:10:39.890 --> 00:10:42.260
I could always see it from 
Treasure Island, too.

00:10:42.260 --> 00:10:43.660
That comet...

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:47.660
How is it related to Treasure Island?

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:57.560
You still only have borrowed limbs.

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:05.110
Shatter, Black Oubu!

00:11:10.990 --> 00:11:13.670
I'll let you off the hook for today, Maxim!

00:11:13.670 --> 00:11:16.030
But next time, I won't go so easy on you!

00:11:16.030 --> 00:11:18.070
Remember that!

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:25.060
The little loser just won't stop whining.

00:11:27.400 --> 00:11:29.400
The first stage in a test to make it

00:11:29.400 --> 00:11:33.800
possible for a heart user 
alone to operate a Buranki...

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:39.510
Guy's so-called special mission 
was no challenge for me.

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:48.220
A black Oubu?

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:50.430
And the one inside it was Kaoruko?

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:57.940
<b>Episode 14
 The False Heart</b>

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:57.940
<b><i>The Gentle Giants
 of the Galaxy</i></b>

00:12:01.070 --> 00:12:02.450
<b>The Gentle Giants of the Galaxy</b>

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:11.710
Pretty efficient,
just like the airport attack.

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:16.080
Guy's Demokratia has good relations 
with most national governments.

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:18.710
He has the power of immense
funds, you might say.

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:20.840
So it's just money, money, money?

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:23.090
That's freaking disgusting.

00:12:24.030 --> 00:12:26.100
The tea is ready.

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:27.330
You get it, right?

00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:31.140
I lost earlier because you guys held me back.

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:34.280
Normally, the great Kaoruko-sama never loses.

00:12:34.280 --> 00:12:35.850
Get it? Understand?

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:38.130
We do. We sure do.

00:12:38.130 --> 00:12:40.160
You're amazing, Kaoruko-sama.

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:41.780
Thanks.

00:12:42.390 --> 00:12:43.510
Thank you.

00:12:46.140 --> 00:12:50.130
Okay, good. If you get it,
I can forgive you.

00:12:50.770 --> 00:12:52.680
By the way, what's your name?

00:12:52.680 --> 00:12:53.950
Kazuki Azuma.

00:12:53.950 --> 00:12:56.000
It's written with the characters 
for "one hope" and "east."

00:12:57.340 --> 00:12:59.100
Huh? "Kazuki"? Then...

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:01.240
Yeah. I'm Kaoruko's older brother.

00:13:01.850 --> 00:13:03.770
Go on, have some tea.

00:13:03.770 --> 00:13:05.050
Thanks.

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:06.540
I will.

00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:09.290
A-chan...

00:13:09.290 --> 00:13:11.360
You came straight from the airport?

00:13:11.360 --> 00:13:12.870
I'm impressed you found your way.

00:13:12.870 --> 00:13:16.020
A-chan, you must be starving, right? Here!

00:13:19.370 --> 00:13:21.370
Thanks, Kogane-chan.

00:13:27.790 --> 00:13:28.940
Kaoruko.

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:32.290
Well, well... And who were you, again?

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:34.910
Was that you in the black Oubu?

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:36.360
What if it was?

00:13:36.360 --> 00:13:37.810
You're not hurt, are you?

00:13:37.810 --> 00:13:41.070
Huh? There's no way I'd ever get hurt!

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:42.300
Who do you think I am?

00:13:43.600 --> 00:13:45.050
How have you been?

00:13:47.560 --> 00:13:49.800
What happened to you, Kaoruko?

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:54.320
You never change, Azuma. You don't get it.

00:13:54.320 --> 00:13:56.310
You don't understand a thing!

00:13:57.810 --> 00:14:01.210
I see... Yeah, maybe not.

00:14:01.210 --> 00:14:04.320
But I have something important to tell you.

00:14:07.250 --> 00:14:10.050
I see you still don't listen 
to what people say, either!

00:14:10.050 --> 00:14:12.370
Most people would respond to,
"You don't get it,"

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:17.320
with something like, 
"Huh? What don't I know?"

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:19.250
It's about Dad.

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:22.340
I know all about that!

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:25.200
Don't act like you're hot stuff!
Stupid! Stupid!

00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:28.980
Guy-sama told me that 
he's on Treasure Island!

00:14:28.980 --> 00:14:33.410
He went back up there a year ago with 
the treatment for Mom's sickness!

00:14:33.410 --> 00:14:35.340
You met her there, didn't you?

00:14:35.340 --> 00:14:36.430
And she was healthy!

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:41.110
Kaoruko, listen to me.

00:14:41.110 --> 00:14:42.170
Hmph!

00:14:42.170 --> 00:14:46.980
All you ever did was run around in 
circles in the palm of my hand.

00:14:46.980 --> 00:14:48.150
What do you mean by that?

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:52.240
You knocked Treasure Island out 
of the sky for me, didn't you?

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:53.370
Nice work.

00:14:54.460 --> 00:14:55.240
What did you say?

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:58.860
You guys made it to 
Treasure Island on a train, right?

00:14:58.860 --> 00:15:03.500
And the lardo from the American team 
told you to break the heart, right?

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:10.480
All of that was arranged by me!

00:15:12.210 --> 00:15:16.060
Kaoruko... Why? Why would you do that?

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:17.350
Tell me why!

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:18.440
Huh?

00:15:18.440 --> 00:15:22.680
Treasure Island, our homeland, 
sank into the sea!

00:15:22.680 --> 00:15:26.740
Treasure island still sits at the bottom 
of the sea, almost exactly as it was!

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:28.860
Guy-sama found out everything for me!

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:32.560
But we don't know what happened 
to Mom when it fell!

00:15:32.560 --> 00:15:34.530
I'm sure she's just fine!

00:15:35.980 --> 00:15:38.850
Think back to when we were little.

00:15:38.850 --> 00:15:40.830
That power she had...

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:45.290
The power that made the whole 
world call her a witch.

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:46.750
Don't you...

00:15:47.510 --> 00:15:50.550
Don't you dare talk about 
your own mother that way!

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:53.720
Shut up! Shut up, shut up!

00:15:54.520 --> 00:15:57.830
Dad sank into the sea along 
with Treasure Island,

00:15:57.830 --> 00:16:00.300
but the island's barrier 
is still functioning.

00:16:00.300 --> 00:16:03.350
So I know Dad's fine, too.

00:16:04.420 --> 00:16:07.940
I'll find him and show 
you myself! You'll see!

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:14.200
I found you,

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:17.430
heart of the Buranki Oubu, Kazuki Azuma!

00:16:17.430 --> 00:16:20.700
You are the one I want to fight!

00:16:25.970 --> 00:16:30.340
Kaoruko, you don't need 
that false heart anymore!

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:41.360
Let go! Let me go!

00:16:41.360 --> 00:16:44.140
I'll catch your mother complex! 
I'll catch your Azuma!

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:57.110
Let go! Let go! Let go, you jerk!

00:16:54.620 --> 00:16:57.110
Quit it! Quit flailing!

00:16:57.110 --> 00:17:01.210
Hey! Why are your eyes closed?!
That's dangerous!

00:17:01.210 --> 00:17:03.640
Look where you're running!

00:17:03.640 --> 00:17:05.580
Wait, are you shivering?

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:09.300
Shut up! I'm just not 
crazy about high places!

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:12.890
They get along well.

00:17:12.890 --> 00:17:14.410
Kaoruko looks so happy.

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:20.910
If you save me, your fear of heights 
will rub off on me, idiot! Idiot!

00:17:20.910 --> 00:17:22.020
Nyah!

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:26.060
Good grief. I guess you haven't changed.

00:17:28.710 --> 00:17:32.110
Turn into your Buranki 
right now, Kazuki Azuma!

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:37.490
Shizuru! Hiiragi!

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:39.530
Kinoa! Kogane-chan!

00:17:39.810 --> 00:17:40.990
We're fusing!

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:41.620
Right!

00:17:42.140 --> 00:17:43.790
Oubu!

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:04.830
I will never forget the 
humiliation you made me feel

00:18:04.830 --> 00:18:07.810
at the Buranki nest, Kazuki Azuma!

00:18:09.320 --> 00:18:10.310
I...

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:14.960
I couldn't stop my home from 
falling from the sky.

00:18:16.130 --> 00:18:18.280
I couldn't protect my mom.

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:22.160
And what's your point, witch's son?

00:18:23.610 --> 00:18:25.570
I can't forgive myself...

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:28.960
But I can't forgive you even more!

00:18:34.040 --> 00:18:38.300
That attack hurt less than a mosquito bite!

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:49.610
We have to defeat that Buranki right here!

00:18:49.610 --> 00:18:50.400
Right!

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:53.110
Don't get cocky!

00:19:06.690 --> 00:19:07.310
Azuma!

00:19:07.310 --> 00:19:08.120
A-chan!

00:19:09.280 --> 00:19:11.380
Kogane-chan, use Righty-chan!

00:19:13.240 --> 00:19:14.670
Okay! I'll try!

00:19:20.600 --> 00:19:23.140
Fly, Righty-chan!

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:34.570
Now, Kinoa!

00:19:34.570 --> 00:19:35.610
You got it!

00:19:36.190 --> 00:19:38.060
Take this!

00:19:40.730 --> 00:19:42.470
Very good, you two!

00:19:42.470 --> 00:19:44.120
Yes, Elder Brother.

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:52.470
Extend, Himekiri! Hoemaru!

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:20.380
Way to go, Azuma!

00:20:20.380 --> 00:20:21.100
Azuma!

00:20:21.100 --> 00:20:22.270
Nice one.

00:20:22.270 --> 00:20:23.860
A-chan, that was awesome!

00:20:28.540 --> 00:20:32.510
Impossible... How could those 
brats defeat Zampaza...

00:20:32.510 --> 00:20:34.140
defeat me?

00:20:39.560 --> 00:20:42.090
Righty-chan, you were so cool!

00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:44.410
You're not Righty-chan anymore.

00:20:44.410 --> 00:20:47.050
You're Super Rocket Punch Righty-san!

00:20:47.050 --> 00:20:49.680
Now, I'll be taking Oubu back.

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:54.100
Undo your link between that 
heart and Oubu's body,

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:55.810
and return Oubu to me.

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:58.650
Don't be dumb. Oubu is ours.

00:20:58.650 --> 00:21:00.000
Shut up!

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:03.030
I wasn't asking you guys, 
so keep your mouths shut!

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:04.450
What'd you say?

00:21:04.450 --> 00:21:06.840
You just don't know when to shut up, do you?

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:10.080
Azuma's so much better just 
because he doesn't yap as much.

00:21:11.240 --> 00:21:13.970
I won't get anywhere talking to dimwits.

00:21:13.970 --> 00:21:14.920
What?

00:21:16.240 --> 00:21:19.800
I need Guy-sama to acknowledge me.

00:21:19.800 --> 00:21:23.670
That's why I need my own Buranki!

00:21:23.670 --> 00:21:26.950
Kaoruko, I can't give Oubu to you.

00:21:27.440 --> 00:21:28.430
But listen to me!

00:21:28.430 --> 00:21:29.530
In that case...

00:21:32.570 --> 00:21:34.390
I'll just have to take it by force!

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:36.810
By crushing that heart in your hands!

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:38.510
Stop it, Kaoruko!

00:21:38.510 --> 00:21:40.480
This is Mom's heart!

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:41.360
Azuma!

00:21:41.850 --> 00:21:43.440
Lakshmi?

00:21:44.520 --> 00:21:45.450
Hiiragi...

00:21:45.450 --> 00:21:49.450
We're the ones you'll be fighting.

00:23:27.170 --> 00:23:30.720
Damn, I got myself completely lost.

00:23:31.360 --> 00:23:33.050
Ow...

00:23:34.870 --> 00:23:38.410
The wound's really aching today.
